## Reporting Issues
If you notice an issue with the website, please let us know so we can investigate and address it.  Click your avatar in the upper right hand corner and select "Report Bug" from the drop-down.  Fill out the form with as much information about the issue you encountered as possible, then click "Submit Report".  

In the event that the bug report form is broken, please click the "Contact" button at the bottom of the website to email us.  Please include the following information in your report:
* Description of what happened when you encountered the issue
* Steps to reproduce the issue
* (Optional) Screenshots of the issue

